<title>GERMANY: German June M3 up annualised 6.4 pct-Buba.</title>
<headline>German June M3 up annualised 6.4 pct-Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank gave the following data on Monday for German M3 money supply growth in June.</p>
<p>						 June 97	   May 97</p>
<p> Annualised vs average Q4 1996	 6.4		7.0 pct</p>
<p> Annualised vs average Q4 1995	 7.4		7.7 pct</p>
<p> Non-annualised vs average Q4 1996   3.7		3.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - The Bundesbank's target range for 1997 M3 money supply growth is 3-1/2 to 6-1/2 percent. Economists polled by Reuters on average had expected M3 growth in June to have slowed to 6.8 or 6.9 percent versus the final quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
